{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：16:11 2026-08-29 HKT</p>\n\n<p>今(29日)早上10時29分，警方接獲一名男子報案，指其年約30多歲母親，在天水圍天晴邨晴彩樓墮樓，救援人員趕至發現女事主危坐在大廈外牆石壆，消防員在地面張開救生氣墊，警方亦派出談判專家到場游說，惟雙方陷於僵局，對峙約5小時後，直至下午3時許，女事主最終一躍而下，倒臥平台，救護員經檢驗後證實當場不治。警方正調查其輕生原因。</p>\n<img alt=\"消防員在地面張開氣墊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/edd5a84ea475322a76b300ee1b00d9ac/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-29_at_15_55_50_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"女事主危坐大廈外牆石壆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/578e6e2fb1e58af703149d63bbec0b83/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-29_at_15_55_50.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b168313bf5017cd1430e4bd74a4cd47d/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-29_at_15_55_49_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c5124c7ee10de9b2afe8c49d34f50731/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-29_at_15_55_49.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"婦人危坐大廈石壆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/26e292703f72a59062fcc223fbe3c5fa/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-29_at_15_55_48_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/51ec26d34b17f9dd8a9f0db81eb97d78/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-29_at_15_55_48.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fdc4ea5f2f353c170fd7b1c25b7124ff/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-29_at_15_55_47_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/df45cad685e9f60456e416a99c0b56e2/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-29_at_15_55_46.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-29T08:38:32.381948+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":188,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}